t('Di HP lama: Beranda → gerigi → Backup & pindah HP. Atur kata sandi backup kalau belum, lalu tekan "Simpan backup ke Drive…" (atau "Backup sekarang" lalu kirim file .infb dari folder Download/Infinity ke HP baru).', 'On the old phone: Home → gear → Backup & move phone. Set a backup password if you have not, then press "Save backup to Drive…" (or "Back up now", then send the .infb file from the Download/Infinity folder to the new phone).', '在旧手机上：首页 → 齿轮 → 备份与换机。如果还没设置备份密码，请先设置，然后点“保存备份到 Drive…”（或点“立即备份”，再把 Download/Infinity 文件夹中的 .infb 文件发到新手机）。')
